 }

=== QB011 | assignment continued into a statement
f:{[]
 result:
 / continued assignment
 if[1b;1];
 result
 }

=== clean | expression conditional has a value
f:{[]
 result:
 $[1b;1;2];
 result
 }

=== QT001 | following unindented statement is not dictionary value
v:`a`b!1 2 3
1 2

=== clean | following unindented statement is not appended to dictionary value
v:`a`b!1 2
1 2 3

=== clean | an unindented block is a separate script expression
f:{[a;b]a+b}
[1;2;3]
til
[1.5]
